  message: "Fixed in PR #3950. Added drift guard property test (TestHighRiskPrimitivesDriftGuard) that asserts every HIGH_RISK_PRIMITIVES entry exists as a qualified_name in at least one io_primitives YAML catalog. Caught and fixed phantom entry stdio.popen → stdlib.popen (C catalog's actual module attribution). Part 2 (catalog→frozenset direction) deferred as noted in the tracker — exemption list would have 344 entries on current corpus."  # 462c
